# Optional per-client mailboxes: "<ip-or-cidr|account> <mailbox>" per line.
# A listed client always sends as its mailbox: the envelope sender and From
# header are overwritten, whatever the printer has configured. Clients not
# listed here choose any sender from allowed_senders, as usual.
# Each mailbox must be in allowed_senders, each account in printer_accounts.
# If both match, the account wins. Among IP entries the first match wins, so
# list single IPs before the networks containing them. This file grants no
# relay access: an IP must also be in trusted_networks unless it authenticates.
# Copy to config/client_senders and edit. Delete/leave empty to disable.
192.168.10.21    scanner@example.com
printer-lobby    printers@example.com
